VALUES ('club_north-easton-meet-mahj-repeat', 'Meet Mahj Repeat', 'north-easton-meet-mahj-repeat', 'Beginner-focused American Mah Jongg group. Its own site: "Brand new to American Mah Jongg? Start here! Learn the tiles, decode the card, master the Charleston, and play a full game in a relaxed, supportive setting," and its classes cover reading the National Mah Jongg League card. Beginners Open/Guided Play runs with an instructor on hand at The Loft at MIMI + Clutch; four-week Mahj 101 series are listed separately. Open Play punch cards are sold online.', (SELECT id FROM City WHERE name = 'North Easton' AND state = 'MA'), 'The Loft at MIMI + Clutch, 19 Belmont Street, North Easton, MA', 'https://meet-mahj-repeat.bamgoodtime.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 'Beginners Open/Guided Play, Monday and Wednesday evenings at 6:00 PM, $20 per night (dates listed on the club site)', 'https://meet-mahj-repeat.bamgoodtime.com', '2026-10-10', 'ACTIVE')
