-- North Easton: checked directly on the club's own pages (2026-10-11). Meet Mahj Repeat says "American Mah Jongg" and teaches the National Mah Jongg League card;
-- 32 dated Beginners Open/Guided Play sessions at a named venue are ACTIVE, so the city clears the five-row minimum.
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'North Easton''s listing centers on Meet Mahj Repeat, a beginner-focused American Mah Jongg group. It runs Beginners Open/Guided Play on Monday and Wednesday evenings at The Loft at MIMI + Clutch on Belmont Street, with an instructor on hand to answer questions as you play, and lists four-week Mahj 101 series for people who have never touched a tile. Sessions are $20 a night, and a punch card brings the price down. Dates are posted on the club''s site, so check the next one before you go.' WHERE "slug" = 'north-easton';
